{"t":"Fruit Sacrifices (Book)","s":"fruit-sacrifices-book-ce172","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Book (Brown)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_c51021.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Paradox%20Tower\">Paradox Tower</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Riddler\">Riddler</a> wants his worshippers to make fruit sacrifices to him.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Riddler\">Riddler</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Mad Mage Valley Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.24<br/>March 15, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The solution to one of the puzzles of <a href=\"#/quest/the-paradox-tower-quest\">The Paradox Tower Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>I will be a better god then the others!<br/>Those who whorship me will have to make sacrifies for me! Yes, they will have to!<br/>What will I ask for? Not much, perhaps food. But i'd be a good god so I only accept plants. No! Better fruits! I love fruits! They have to sacrifice a melon for instance. Oh and then a banana!! But I love cherrys too! So they have to bring them too, yes yes!<br/>Then they have to invoke a ritual, involving an apple, and and and ... grapes! Grapes are important! Yes indeed! And for the last sacrifice I demand a coconut from my faithfull. Only then they are allowed to ascend to my throne! Oh, yes what a joy for them!</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-paradox-tower-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-paradox-tower-quest","quest":"The Paradox Tower Quest","step":"1-11","n":16,"title":"Puzzle das frutas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}